{"supplier":"hotelbeds","supplierHotelId":"594984","name":"Athenaeum Grand Hotel","description":"Come visit Greece's Capital Athens, a world-renowned historical, cultural and educational city. Located in the heart of Athens offers the very best in sophisticated design where personalised service meets a serious commitment to luxury. This hotel is within 10 km of Acropolis, Parthenon, and Acropolis Museum. Travellers looking for a getaway offering every modern amenity will find exactly what they are looking for. With many local attractions and amazing amenities, the hotel is the perfect place to spend a vacation. Athens International Airport is 40-minute drive away. The rooms and suites are fitted with hardwood floors, well-chosen furnishings and soft colours. Each comes with a modern bathroom with shower cabin, hairdryer and toiletries. Some units open to a balcony or terrace and some offer breath-taking views over the Acropolis. Everything that makes the stay in Athens an unforgettable experience is right here at the hotel. Whether travelling for business or pleasure, guests of the hotel find all they need and more at a great price.","address":"Leoforos Andrea Siggrou, 142","city":"Kallithea","countryCode":"GR","postalCode":"176 71","lat":37.95854680155289,"lng":23.718661021179173,"stars":4,"giataCode":"674450","phone":"+302109222500","email":"sales@athenaeumgrandhotel.com","website":"www.athenaeumgrandhotel.com","images":[{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/59/594984/594984a_hb_a_005.jpg","category":"exterior","order":0},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/59/594984/594984a_hb_a_006.jpg","category":"exterior","order":1},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/59/594984/594984a_hb_a_007.jpg","category":"exterior","order":2},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/59/594984/594984a_hb_a_004.jpg","category":"exterior","order":3},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/59/594984/594984a_hb_l_001.jpg","category":